# nishu.dev Project Context (LLM Token-Optimized)
# Format: Compact YAML-like DSL | Version: 2.0.0 | Updated: 2026-08-31

PROJECT:
  name: nishu.dev
  type: Next.js 14 Portfolio Web App (App Router, JS/TS hybrid)
  owner: Nishan Rajak (Backend-Focused Software Engineering Student @ ICFAI Univ Jharkhand)
  repo: nishuR31/nishu.dev
  live_url: https://nishudevportfolio.vercel.app
  api_default: https://nishu-dev-api.onrender.com
  branch_active: test-branch (deployed to Vercel; push test-branch:main to promote to prod)

TECH_STACK:
  framework: Next.js 14.2.15 (App Router, Static Site Generation + SSR)
  react: 18.3.1
  typescript: 5.6.2 (in dependencies — NOT devDependencies, required for Vercel build)
  state: Redux Toolkit 2.12.0 + react-redux 9.3.0
  styling: TailwindCSS 3.4.14 + styled-components 6.5.1 + tailwindcss-animate
  fonts: GeistVF (local), Outfit (Google Fonts)
  image_format: AVIF (logo.avif, logo-84.avif, logo-180.avif, iitSitting.avif, projects/*.avif)
  package_manager: bun (authoritative bun.lock; package-lock.json removed)
  build_cmd: "bun run build" (runs: rm -rf .next && next build)

ENV_VARS:
  NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL: Backend API root (optional; default: https://nishu-dev-api.onrender.com)
  NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND: Alias for API URL (optional fallback)
  NEXT_PUBLIC_FRONTEND_URL: Site canonical root (default: https://nishudevportfolio.vercel.app)
  NEXT_PUBLIC_SERVICE_ID: EmailJS service key
  NEXT_PUBLIC_TEMPLATE_ID: EmailJS template key
  NEXT_PUBLIC_PUBLIC_KEY: EmailJS public key

ROUTING_STRUCTURE:
  app/layout.js: Root layout — SSR fetchPortfolioData(), seeds Redux via <Providers initialData={...}>
  app/(home)/page.jsx: Home (/) — Hero, About, Experience, GithubProjects, Skills, Certificates sections
  app/experience/page.tsx: [NEW] Dedicated /experience page — SSR timeline + full write-up
  app/(projects)/projects/page.tsx: /projects — client component, reads from Redux (usePortfolio)
  app/(projects)/projects/[slug]/page.tsx: /projects/[slug] — SSR initial project, client hydration fallback
  app/(certificates)/certificates/page.tsx: /certificates — certificate grid
  app/contact/page.tsx: /contact — contact form (EmailJS)
  app/settings/page.tsx: /settings — theme settings
  app/not-found.tsx: 404 handler
  app/error.tsx: Runtime error boundary

STATE_MANAGEMENT:
  store/configStore.ts: Redux store setup (portfolioSlice + themeSlice)
  store/index.ts: Custom hooks — useTheme, usePortfolio (read-only selectors from Redux)
  slices/portfolioSlice.ts: portfolio data, loading, error state (DEFAULT_PORTFOLIO = empty schema)
  slices/themeSlice.ts: "dark" | "light" | "system" theme
  components/reduxProvider.jsx: [CRITICAL] Seeds Redux synchronously from SSR initialData; if null → client retry (3 attempts, 20s timeout each)

DATA_SEEDING_FLOW:
  1. app/layout.js runs getPortfolioData() server-side (3 retries × 30s timeout)
  2. initialData passed to <Providers initialData={...}>
  3. reduxProvider.jsx dispatches fetchSuccess(initialData) SYNCHRONOUSLY before first paint
  4. If initialData null (API cold start): client-side fetchWithRetry fires after mount (3×20s)
  5. Components use usePortfolio() → read from Redux; show skeleton if loading=true

API_DATA_SCHEMA (nishu-dev-api.onrender.com/portfolio → { success, data: {...} }):
  developer: { name, shortName, role, tagline, bio, location, email, about[] }
  featuredProjects: string[]
  social: { email, github, discord, linkedin, leetcode, hackerone, twitter }
  NAV_ITEMS: { href, label }[]  [includes /experience now]
  recentTracks: boolean
  projects[12]: {
    id, title, description, image, technologies[], github, demo,
    problem, solution, role, timeline, highlights[], categories[]  [NEW FIELDS]
  }
  skills[4]: { title, iconKey, description, bgClass, iconClass, skills: { name, level, hot? }[] }
  experiences[2]: { position, company, period, location, description, responsibilities[], technologies[] }
  contactInfo[]: { iconKey, label, value, link }
  certificates[30]: { url }
  additionalProjects: string[]
  strengths: string[]

KEY_COMPONENTS:
  components/reduxProvider.jsx: Provider wrapper + data seeding (CRITICAL PATH)
  components/features/home/HeroSection.tsx: Shows HeroSkeleton while loading
  components/features/home/About.tsx: Shows AboutSkeleton while loading
  components/features/home/Experience.tsx: Shows ExperienceSkeleton; also on /experience page
  components/features/home/Skills.tsx: Shows SkillsSkeleton while loading
  components/features/home/Certificates.tsx: Shows CertificatesSkeleton while loading
  components/features/projects/ProjectDetailView.tsx: [RICH] Client component — renders problem/solution/role/highlights/tech
  components/features/projects/ProjectsList.jsx: Project cards grid
  components/ui/skeletons.jsx: All skeleton loaders (HeroSkeleton, AboutSkeleton, etc.)
  lib/portfolio.ts: Server-side getPortfolioData() — 3 retries × 30s timeout
  lib/slug-utils.ts: getProjectSlugs(p) — generates all slug aliases for a project (hyphen, compact, repo name, id)

VERCEL_DEPLOYMENT:
  vercel.json: { framework: nextjs, buildCommand: "bun run build", installCommand: "rm -rf node_modules && bun install", outputDirectory: ".next" }
  KNOWN_ISSUE: Vercel build cache can corrupt node_modules; vercel.json installCommand forces wipe
  KNOWN_ISSUE: Render free tier cold-starts (30-50s); lib/portfolio.ts retries handle this at build time
  KNOWN_ISSUE: TypeScript must be in "dependencies" (not devDependencies) for Vercel bun build to find it
  ACTIVE_BRANCH: test-branch → push to main to trigger production build

BUILD_STATS (last clean build):
  Pages: 38/38 static (including /experience + all project slug aliases)
  Exit code: 0
  First Load JS shared: 87.2 kB
